1
00:00:28,622 --> 00:00:36,977
Two-stroke engine growls out loud
Steep hill climbs into the cloud

2
00:00:38,044 --> 00:00:46,222
Cold hands hold tight on the wheel
Biting wind is all I feel

3
00:00:47,644 --> 00:00:52,177
Black curls flowing, fresh and young
A song that never has been sung

4
00:00:52,232 --> 00:00:59,343
Glasses with a white frame glow
Softly laughing, she starts to show

5
00:01:06,722 --> 00:01:15,522
Push the heavy wooden door
Candle wax upon the floor

6
00:01:16,233 --> 00:01:23,788
High and quiet, wide and deep
Where the old echoes sleep

7
00:01:25,522 --> 00:01:30,366
“Here’s your map,” her red lips smile
Warm fingers touch my arm a while

8
00:01:30,509 --> 00:01:37,265
Strange hunger in my chest
A sudden sunrise, soul at rest

9
00:01:44,602 --> 00:01:52,558
Heavy coats and rosy cheeks
Warmth that every shadow seeks

10
00:01:54,024 --> 00:02:02,158
Seventy voices, thick and old
Welcoming me from the cold

11
00:02:03,419 --> 00:02:08,263
Black curls flowing, fresh and young
A song that never has been sung

12
