Softly laughing, she starts to show

13
00:02:22,375 --> 00:02:30,419
Clapping hands and eyes of grace
Suddenly I find my place

14
00:02:31,886 --> 00:02:39,753
No more hiding in the dark
Paul the organist, the spark

15
